72,east,"My plan is to move towards the stairs down, which is located southwest from my current position. To do this, I will need to navigate through the horizontal and vertical walls, and the dark areas. Since I am a healer, I don't have any strong preferences or abilities that would affect my movement, so I will focus on finding a safe and efficient path to the stairs down.

To achieve this, I will start by searching the current room to see if there are any hidden doors or passages that I can use to bypass the walls. If not, I will try to kick the horizontal wall to the southwest to see if I can create an opening. If that doesn't work, I will try to move around the room to find a different path to the stairs down.

